st and hone your brain\u2019s cognitive skills.\nThis cognitive VR-training could be a useful addition to comprehensive COVID-19 recovery regimen.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "504435614361156", "locale": "ru_RU", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Upgrade VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "UPGRADE VR \u043f\u043e\u0437\u0432\u043e\u043b\u044f\u0435\u0442 \u043b\u0435\u0433\u043a\u043e \u0438 \u0438\u0433\u0440\u0430\u044e\u0447\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u043a\u0430\u0447\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043a\u043e\u0433\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0441\u043f\u043e\u0441\u043e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044b\u043c\u0438 \u0443\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0436\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f\u043c\u0438, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u0435 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u043b\u0438 \u043d\u0435\u0439\u0440\u043e\u043f\u0441\u0438\u0445\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438.\n\n\u0422\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043a\u0438 \u0432 UPGRADE VR \u0443\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0430\u044e\u0442 \u043a\u043e\u0433\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0444\u0443\u043d\u043a\u0446\u0438\u0438:\n\n- \u043f\u0430\u043c\u044f\u0442\u044c\n- \u043a\u043e\u043d\u0446\u0435\u043d\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f \u0438 \u0443\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0439\u0447\u0438\u0432\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0432\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f\n- \u0440\u0435\u0430\u043a\u0446\u0438\u044f\n- \u043a\u043e\u043e\u0440\u0434\u0438\u043d\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f\n- \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0441\u043e\u0443\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0439\u0447\u0438\u0432\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c\n\n\u0415\u0436\u0435\u0434\u043d\u0435\u0432\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043a\u0438 \u043d\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u044e\u0442 \u043c\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438 \u0438 \u043d\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0434\u043e\u0435\u0434\u0430\u044e\u0442 \u0431\u043b\u0430\u0433\u043e\u0434\u0430\u0440\u044f \u0438\u043d\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0441\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u0438\u0433\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0435.\n\n\u041e\u0442\u0441\u043b\u0435\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0433\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0441 \u0443\u0434\u043e\u0431\u043d\u043e \u0432 \u043c\u043e\u0431\u0438\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u043c \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0438. \u0412 \u043d\u0451\u043c \u043c\u043e\u0436\u043d\u043e \u0443\u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u0442\u044c \u0441\u043f\u0438\u0441\u043e\u043a \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438\u0445 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439, \u0430 \u0435\u0449\u0451 \u0432 \u043c\u043e\u0431\u0438\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u043c \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043b\u043e\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0438 \u043f\u0443\u0431\u043b\u0438\u043a\u0443\u044e\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044c\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e \u043e\u0441\u043e\u0431\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u044b \u043c\u043e\u0437\u0433\u0430 \u0438 \u043d\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0435 \u043e\u0442\u043a\u0440\u044b\u0442\u0438\u044f \u043d\u0435\u0439\u0440\u043e\u043f\u0441\u0438\u0445\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0438\u0438.\n\n\u041a\u043e\u0433\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043a\u0438 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0443\u0442 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0437\u043d\u044b \u0432 \u043a\u043e\u043c\u043f\u043b\u0435\u043a\u0441\u043d\u043e\u043c \u0432\u043e\u0441\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0438 \u043e\u0440\u0433\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0437\u043c\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u0441\u043b\u0435 COVID-19.\n\n\n\u041d\u0430\u0447\u043d\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u043a\u0430\u0447\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u043c\u043e\u0437\u0433 \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0441\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0434\u043d\u044f!", "short_description": "UPGRADE VR \u2014 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0442\u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0430 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043a\u0438 \u043a\u043e\u0433\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0441\u043f\u043e\u0441\u043e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0435\u0439 \u043f\u0440\u0438 \u043f\u043e\u043c\u043e\u0449\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044b\u0445 \u0438\u0433\u0440\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0445 \u0443\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0436\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439, \u0441\u043e\u0437\u0434\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u043d\u0435\u0439\u0440\u043e\u043f\u0441\u0438\u0445\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0433\u0430\u043c\u0438. \u041a\u043e\u0433\u043d\u0438\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043a\u0438 \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0443\u0442 \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0437\u043d\u044b \u0432 \u043a\u043e\u043c\u043f\u043b\u0435\u043a\u0441\u043d\u043e\u043c \u0432\u043e\u0441\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0438 \u043e\u0440\u0433\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0437\u043c\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u0441\u043b\u0435 COVID-19."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://upgrade-vr.com/en/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://upgrade-vr.com/en/platform-agreement", "publisher_name": "Mental Tech LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://upgrade-vr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS", "MEDICINE", "ARCADE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ru"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "252620430298763"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "23986158110971326", "version": "1.6.0"}, "id": "1078026156263305", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7524228527590878", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "23986158110971326"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1078026156263305"}]}, "change_log": "1.6.0", "created_date": 1688759071, "id": "23986158110971326", "version": "1.6.0", "version_code": 5, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7524228527590878", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "23986158110971326"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1078026156263305"}]}, "change_log": "v1.5.0\n- Added analytics system: graphs with training results\n- Added new music tracks\n- Added leaderboards (in UI and on the big screen at the location)\n- Fixed minor bugs with UI display\n- Added mini-game \"Tower of Ice Cubes\"\n- Pause is now activated when the user removes the HMD (Oculus)\n- New Stress Factor - Lizard\n- New Stress Factor - Robot Vacuum Cleaner\n- New environment: added volcano and eruption\n- New environment: added spaceship\n- New to the environment: added window cleaning robot\n- New environment: added flying robot birds\n- New environment: Ventilation tapes\n- New to the environment: added neon ceiling lights\n- Updated material for hand tracking game mode (Oculus Quest)\n- Fixed lighting from external lamps when roller shutters are closed\n- Added activity monitoring system and display of burned kcal during training\n- Fixed missing session end stats in tutorial when ending via pause menu\n- Added additional HUD on the player's hand\n- Fixed a bug with playing background music when starting the \"Geometric Runner\" mini-game\n- Fixed pause timer, now it shows the correct elapsed time\n- The player can no longer interact with objects while paused in training\n- Fixed memorization time on difficulty level 0\n- Installation of new monitors on the main level, updated appearance of bonuses\n- Fixed neuropoints going beyond four digits or higher in the pause menu\n- Fixed shifting of hands in collisions during reaction training\n- Updated the physics of the game table in the mini-game \"Ping-Pong\"\n- Fixed practice menu options showing the first values from the list instead of the actual difficulty level 0 values when opening the menu\n\n---\nTrain your brain with pleasure!", "created_date": 1679919540, "id": "9624241030922940", "version": "1.5.0", "version_code": 4, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7524228527590878", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "23986158110971326"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1078026156263305"}]}, "change_log": "Update v.1.4.0\n\nList of modifications:\n\n- Redesigned interface (UI)\n- Added new user registration in VR (without mobile app)\n- Added \"Delete account\" function\n- Added Steam Authorization\n- Redesigned the appearance of awards\n- New balancing of difficulty parameters in all trainings\n- Added bonus - \"Water\"\n- Added bonus - \"Ice\"\n- Added bonus - \"Markers\"\n- Added bonus - \"Game table: Air Hockey and Ping-Pong\"\n- Bonus Monitor displaying a list of bonus items and mini-games\n- Added new training stressors (sparks, lizard, renovation noise, l- ighting problems)\n- New difficulty system - new types of difficulty at every 20 levels in all 5 trainings\n- Optimized 3D models and location materials\n- Added introductory tutorial (text, screenshots)\n- New shelves for awards\n- Added roller shutter control panel - now you can change the lighting of the room when playing on the holographic game table\n- Updated development team list\n- Transition to Unreal Engine version 4.27\n- Improved the mechanics of catching projectiles in the REACTION training\n- Improved shape generator in the SYNCHRONIZATION training\n- Updated VFX in COORDINATION training\n- Received bonus items are now hidden during training\n- Added connection error message if game server or internet is not available.\n- Added new sound effects to trainings\n- Updated parameters in the \"training\" mode\n- Added collisions for location objects\n- Added UI scrolling with stick/trackpad.\n- Removed notification about saving progress every 5 difficulty level for guest user.\n- Fixed bugs with the exchange of profile data\n- Fixed bugs with saving configured parameters\n- Animation and hand posing bug fixed\n- Fixed animation of opening/closing roller blinds\n- Fixed a bug with filling the cup in the \"Coffee Machine\" bonus\n- Fixed capture and transfer of physical objects during teleportation\n- Fixed binding to trainer activation point when user is already standing on the activation marker\n- Fixed an issue where pause was available after the game ended", "created_date": 1659341973, "id": "8397338293613226", "version": "1.4.0", "version_code": 3, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7524228527590878", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "23986158110971326"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1078026156263305"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1643811657, "id": "7534664569880607", "version": "1.3.1", "version_code": 2, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7524228527590878", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "23986158110971326"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1643754533, "id": "7530874403592957", "version": "1.3.0", "version_code": 1, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}